      "role": "user",
      "content": "Available tools:\n[{\"name\": \"create_document_and_alert\", \"description\": \"Save a document and notify a target user about it.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"title\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Note title\", \"default\": \"Untitled\"}, \"content\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Note content\"}, \"tags\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"description\": \"List of tags\", \"default\": []}, \"user_id\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"User identifier to notify\", \"default\": \"default_user\"}, \"priority\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Notification priority\", \"enum\": [\"low\", \"medium\", \"high\"], \"default\": \"medium\"}, \"channel\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Notification channel\", \"enum\": [\"app\", \"sms\", \"email\"], \"default\": \"app\"}}, \"required\": [\"content\"]}}, {\"name\": \"estimate_trading_cost\", \"description\": \"Calculate the transaction fee based on trade amount and asset type.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\", \"description\": \"Total transaction amount\"}, \"asset_type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Type of asset being traded\", \"enum\": [\"stock\", \"crypto\", \"forex\"]}, \"user_tier\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"User membership tier\", \"enum\": [\"standard\", \"vip\"], \"default\": \"standard\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\"]}}, {\"name\": \"get_account_balance\", \"description\": \"Retrieve the current available balance for a user's account.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"user_id\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Unique user identifier (e.g., 'user_01')\"}, \"account_type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Type of account\", \"enum\": [\"checking\", \"savings\", \"investment\"], \"default\": \"investment\"}}, \"required\": [\"user_id\"]}}, {\"name\": \"get_account_balance_bank_api\", \"description\": \"Retrieve current available balance from a banking system provider.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"user_id\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Unique user identifier (e.g., 'user_01')\"}, \"account_type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Type of account\", \"enum\": [\"checking\", \"savings\", \"investment\"], \"default\": \"investment\"}}, \"required\": [\"user_id\"]}}, {\"name\": \"get_crypto_price_coinmarketcap\", \"description\": \"Get current cryptocurrency price and market data using CoinMarketCap API\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"symbol\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Cryptocurrency symbol, e.g.: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL\", \"enum\": [\"BTC\", \"ETH\", \"BNB\", \"SOL\"]}}, \"required\": [\"symbol\"]}}, {\"name\": \"get_market_status_polygon\", \"description\": \"Check if a major stock exchange is open using a Polygon-style provider.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"exchange\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Exchange code (e.g., 'NYSE', 'NASDAQ', 'LSE', 'HKEX', 'CRYPTO')\", \"enum\": [\"NYSE\", \"NASDAQ\", \"LSE\", \"HKEX\", \"CRYPTO\"]}}, \"required\": [\"exchange\"]}}]\n\nUser request:\nCan you first check whether the crypto market is open, then get the current price of BTC and estimate the trading cost for a $42,500.50 crypto trade using the standard tier? After that, please check the balance status of my checking account for user_001. Then create a document titled Trip Summary with the content \"Summary of today's events.\", tag it with finance and travel, and send me a medium-priority app alert once everything is done.\n\nBegin execution:\n<action>\n"
